# Large rasters anywhere under art-source (concept, reference, WIP)
art-source/**/*.png
art-source/**/*.jpg
art-source/**/*.jpeg
art-source/**/*.webp
art-source/**/*.gif
art-source/**/*.bmp

# Re-allow tracked scaffolding inside art-source
!art-source/**/
!art-source/README.md
!art-source/**/README.md
!art-source/**/.gitkeep
